### Pré-checkout: plano Premium
# @name pre
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "products": [{ "slug": "premium" }] }

### Checkout aprovado (cartão de crédito)
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{pre.response.body.cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Crédito",
    "card": { "holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4111111111114242", "expiry": "12/28", "cvv": "123" }
  }
}

### Pagamento duplicado (o mesmo carrinho de novo) → 409 CART_ALREADY_PAID
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cartId": "{{pre.response.body.cartId}}", "paymentMethod": { "name": "Pix" } }

### Novo carrinho para testar a recusa
# @name pre2
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "products": [{ "slug": "familia" }] }

### Cartão terminado em 0002 → 422 PAYMENT_DECLINED
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{pre2.response.body.cartId}}",
  "paymentMethod": {
    "name": "Cartão de Débito",
    "card": { "holderName": "Ana Souza", "number": "4000000000000002", "expiry": "12/28", "cvv": "123" }
  }
}

### Depois da recusa, Pix no mesmo carrinho → aprovado com pixCode
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cartId": "{{pre2.response.body.cartId}}", "paymentMethod": { "name": "Pix" } }

### Produto inexistente → 422 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/pre-checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "products": [{ "slug": "ultra" }] }

### Carrinho inexistente → 404 CART_NOT_FOUND
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cartId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "paymentMethod": { "name": "Pix" } }

### Meio não oferecido → 422 PAYMENT_METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED
POST http://localhost:8080/operations/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cartId": "{{pre2.response.body.cartId}}", "paymentMethod": { "name": "Boleto" } }
